hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"972","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aadhi raat ko nikley aur masjid mein namaz padhi aur aadmiyon ne Aapki namaz key sath namaz padhi. Ye hadees Namaz ki kitaab mein guzar chuki hai aur donon key darmiyaan lafzon mein mukhaalifat hai. Aur is riwayat key aakhir mein farmaya: To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) faut ho gaey jabke muamla usi par tha. (Bukhari: 2012). Lailat-ul-Qadr key fazl ki kitaab."
